This would go with Spork's partial resistances.

For any resistance you've gotten from eating, everytime you check to
exercise stats, roll d100 vs the current percentage resistance.  If
the roll is less than or equal to the current level then reduce it by
1%.  So if you are currently at 100% then you are sure to go to 99% on
the next check, but if you are only at 20% then it takes an average of
five checks to knock you down to 19%.

Racial or level gained resistances, crowning, armor, rings, etc. would
not be subject to this.  (It would be neat if some of the level gained
resistances were changed to say 5% per level though.)

